    },
    {
      "id": "quote:38f4ddc6d89e6c3e",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 477,
        "char_start": 363,
        "episode_id": "e3d8c7e5-2b7b-572b-a226-ddec128285ca",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "What's the one heuristic you keep coming back to? What's the structural angle most listeners don't have access to?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:8b6c9778e0062ed6",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 691,
        "char_start": 491,
        "episode_id": "e3d8c7e5-2b7b-572b-a226-ddec128285ca",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Here's how I think about it. Sometimes the point of a conversation is not having a point. We've seen this play out at teams using Substack. I've watched this pattern hold across three different teams.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:7b35e250a1964aff",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 799,
        "char_start": 697,
        "episode_id": "e3d8c7e5-2b7b-572b-a226-ddec128285ca",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "What does the failure mode look like? What's the structural angle most listeners don't have access to?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:7b51e5605ba48ec5",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 948,
        "char_start": 813,
        "episode_id": "e3d8c7e5-2b7b-572b-a226-ddec128285ca",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "It comes down to this: Dialogue-heavy formats trade grounding for texture. I've watched this pattern hold across three different teams.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
